[32m+[m[32m| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |[m
[32m+[m[32m| **Volatile Memory**      | Data stored in RAM that may be lost when the system is powered off. |[m
[32m+[m[32m| **Non-Volatile Storage** | Data stored on devices such as hard disks, SSDs, and USB drives.    |[m
 [m
[31m-HTTP forms commonly use two request methods:[m
